/// (P24 R17: L03A tracks 2+3 are ridden to changetrack 0x121 -> LoadLevel EP4\L03B; old fake `warp 2a000121`.)
/// FAKES: none. (fixed WP-P21 R25: L01 used `play 3`; now the real puzzle: buttons 0x135/0x136, checkpoint 0x2c, 8 scares
/// at 0x188 (button bits survive), switch 0x10b (unlock), weight puzzles 0x172/0x173 (pipes 0x100/0xff), carts
/// 0x101/0x102/0x10d pushed, rotating pipes turned (bit 2 water end pipe, bit 1 pivot 0x103/0x106), then at the
/// original 30 fps (`hz 30`, ENGINE.INI MaxFPS = 30) the mansion valves 0x11f/0x120 (handle collectable 0x63)/0x121
/// (bit 0) -> (GD+4)+8 & 7 == 7 -> Hotspot_DiagramVO 0x12c -> camera 0x1de P2=3 -> cut-scene 3 end -> LOADER.
/// The leak valves 0x122..0x125 only stop leaks (inv_control 0x190) and are not needed.)
/// (fixed WP-P21: L02B race start is real: warp the leader onto mercenary 0x2a0000cc -> it spots the hero ->
/// Mercenary_Base_FuncAlertAllMercenaries sends 0xde to inv_race 0x2a0000e5 (once, GD+0x28) -> countdown timer ->
/// LoadLevel EP4\L03A; the old fake was `m @inv_race de 0`.)
/// (fixed WP-P21 R13: L04 boss is real: 5 zombie captures (hs_commun 0x2a0000cc recall + truck wisps `cw` between),
/// controller 0x2a0000c7 -> 0xde boss, three short book pulls with the phase wisp drops collected in between -> binding
/// -> 0xd6/0x68 -> end movie -> LOADER; old fake `m 2a0000bc d6 68`.)
/// (P24 R4: L04 zombie chase + wisp pickups are walked (`bookzg`, no warps); keep 2.5 m off zombies: a touch
/// scares the hero (hero_scared 0xc9 -> L04 gamecontroller Reset, capture count back to 0).)
/// EP4/L01 `g 2 0 3f` = EP4 episode-start state (TITLE Panel.c EP4 select case 0x41; EP2 `g 2 0 7`, EP3 `g 2 0 1f`);
/// without it the L04 book never opens (GB2+0 = 0x40 only).
/// (fixed WP-P19: the L01 -> LOADER -> L02A sector-clipping fault was non-persistent game buffers carried across
/// LoadLevel; EFGameMemoryMgr::Terminate deletes them, gameobj::CarriedGameBuffers)
/// (P22 R2: L01 opening real -- key 0x65, door 0x09, door 0x0b from the south (`goto 547 280; goto 556 280`), real
/// button 0x136 + `gw` checkpoint 0x2c; the pipe pivots are turned state-driven (`until UID 24 TARGET N ...`:
/// local+0x24 = orientation, targets fd/fe 4, 103..10a 2), so the tail no longer depends on frame timing.)
/// (P22 R3: pivot 0x106 turned by a real walk right after switch 0x10b (`goto 557.25 276.5`, handle tag 200 on the
/// gallery); 0x108 approach moved to 566.842,250.78 (the 566.542,250.137 landing no longer touched it). The gallery
/// pipes 0x103+0x106 (inv_control 0xc0e8 & 10) enable switch 0x10c -> stairs 0x17b down to the pit floor.)
/// P24 R24 (fixed follower): floor snacks 0x3f/0x40 (gw) eaten before 0x108 restore courage; the pivot-leg
/// `waitfar` gates were dropped (the hero waited at the snacks while 0x18c patrolled within 14 m of the pivots and got
/// scared); one route for default, NODESET and ANIMSND (the EP4/L01 ANIMSND variant is gone).
/// P24 R25: gallery real (0x103 east push; under NODESET the hero is pinned east of the pipe and walks round it
/// south via `ifx`; switch 0x10c, stairs 0x17b) replaces `wxyz 556.2 6 256.5`; 0x108 leg gated `waitfar 8` on 0x18b/0x18c.
/// P24 R46 (landed P22 R45): floor ghosts 0x18c/0x18b captured with the book (`bookgs`) first; then walked: 0x172 box,
/// cart 0x101 pushed west from its east side (GB2+8 |= 0x40), pivot 0x104 pushed from the north (opens the pen), 0x173
/// box via the south floor. Replaces `warp 2a000172` / `warp 2a000173` (order 172 -> cart -> 173 needed for GB2+8 & 7 == 7).
/// P24 R47: before the 0x121 valve walk, `waitx 2a00018a 262 300 1500` (never true: 0x18a roams x 236..242, so a fixed
/// 1500 f) -> `untilp 2a00018a 242 258 >2 150 f 10` = wait for yard ghost 0x18a on its north-bound leg past (242,258).
